<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/actively-open-minded-thinking> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A thinking disposition, named by Jonathan Baron, in which a person searches thoroughly and fairly for possibilities, evidence and goals, gives weight to evidence against a favoured view, and holds confidence in proportion to the search actually done." .
