<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Does the speaker's conduct actually bear on whether the claim is true, or only on the speaker's character?" .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/1> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/2> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Are the speaker's situation and the situation the advice addresses really alike, or is the \"inconsistency\" a false double standard?" .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/2> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#CriticalQuestion> .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/3> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Is the lapse a settled habit, or a one-off failure, a past choice, or a matter of weak will that the speaker admits?" .
<https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque/cq/3> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/ontology#questionFor> <https://github.com/john1hsu/critical-thinking-graph/id/tu-quoque> .
